(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts on April 7, 2023 released a video to explain the meaning of traditional dance. According to the Ministry of Culture, the Trudeau dance is the legacy of the Samre people, who are thousands of years old on the territory of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
According to the Ministry of Culture, the word Trud is the original word from the Sanskrit language, which means to cut off or cut off, referring to the end of the year or cut off the old year into the new year, which is named after a royal ceremony called Trisangkan To this day.
Trud dance is a dance that represents the passing of the old year, moving the new year and getting rid of bad luck, and to give blessings to the locals on the occasion of the new year.
