The Council for the Development of Cambodia and the Cambodian Duke Association are committed to working together in partnership to promote trade and investment.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister, Secretary General of the Council for the Development of Cambodia (CDC), stated that the Council for the Development of Cambodia and the Cambodian Duke Association will work together in partnership to promote local investment and attract Foreign investment to promote trade and investment in Cambodia.
Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea stated this during a meeting between the Council for the Development of Cambodia and the Cambodian Duke Association on the afternoon of April 6, 2023.
Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea said that the Cambodian Duke Association is a new partner in helping the Council for the Development of Cambodia attract foreign investors and expand investment growth in Cambodia.
He said that in the first meeting, the two sides discussed the work to be done together in initiating the promotion of trade and investment. And the Council for the Development of Cambodia will prepare a draft memorandum outlining the purpose of the cooperation that both parties are working together to attract investors.
He said that in the past, the CDC has worked with the private sector, such as the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, but the future plans with the Duke Association will not overlap with the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, that is, what needs to be done. Next is the same action as the Chamber of Commerce.
He said that the presence of the Cambodian Duke Association is very important to help attract foreign investors, because in general, foreign investors who come to seek investment opportunities in Cambodia always meet with their embassy, but also want to meet with local businesses to find out. Or collaborate.
Oknha Hun Lak, Secretary General of the Cambodian Duke Association, stated that according to the Royal Government of Cambodia, the Cambodian Duke Association is under the technical governance of the Council for the Development of Cambodia, so the mission of this association will be to promote trade. And investing in Cambodia.
"In this meeting, to discuss the mechanisms that are planned for what we will do in 2023 and what we will do next year in order to promote trade and investment in Cambodia," he said.
