The purpose of this visit is to exchange experiences on the 32nd SEA Games Prevention Plan and to evaluate any security work that IMEST can support the Cambodian National Police in maintaining security, order and safety during the event. From May 5 to 17, 2023.
Through a brief presentation on the 32nd SEA Games defense plan, the IMEST team appreciated the assignment of command, leadership and deployment of security forces in each of the key areas, especially prevention work to ensure safety and security.
In addition, the IMEST team assured the Cambodian National Police in the planned defense based on the successful experience implemented in the security and safety operations at the 1st ASEAN Summit. 40 and 41 and related meetings in 2022.
Through direct inspections of the venue, as well as through meetings to exchange views on technical work, including meetings with management and receptionists at Phnom Penh International Airport, the IMEST Leading Team has identified the work that The operation team can support the Cambodian National Police before and during the SEA Games with the following 3 skills:
* First, the technical equipment of the I-BATCH system for monitoring the entry and exit data of Cambodia (especially international guests) to ensure that persons who enter and leave Cambodia during that period are not identified in the data provided by the General Secretariat. Interpol has received requests from member countries to target terrorism, crime or violence in the past.
* Second, anti-technology experts in preparation for responding to some malicious acts may be attacked by spreading false information about the conduct of the SEA Games in Cambodia, including pollution, security on social media or other foreign websites. More.
* Third: Experienced consultants in managing and solving problems in events with large crowds, especially in international sports events.
In response to the offer made by the IMEST Leading Team, the representative of the General Commission of the National Police of Cambodia, on behalf of the Chairman of the Security and Public Order Committee of the 32nd SEA Games, welcomed and accepted the support of INTERPOL.
However, the General Commission of the National Police needs to discuss with the command in charge of each profession to feed these skills appropriately and ensure effective cooperation.
She states that printing banknotes in different sizes and colors has different benefits in terms of size, allowing blind people to use the banknotes by noting the size, while the color of the banknotes is a given color option. High security that can not be copied.
Ms. Chea Serey's explanation was made on the occasion of participating in the dissemination program on Riel Financial Literacy in Sihanoukville on April 5, 2023.
She explained that the small and large banknotes are not only in Cambodia, even in Europe, the euro is small and the Singaporean is the same. Therefore, the printing of small and large banknotes is different from the small size of the banknotes, providing many benefits, especially for the blind who can feel the size of the banknote.
She stated that for the printing of small and large banknotes, the National Bank of Cambodia has focused on the use of all people, in fact, on each banknote, the National Bank of Cambodia also printed letters for the disabled. This means that for the visually impaired can touch the letters on the banknote, but for the blind the illiterate can mark the small and large size of each banknote.
The explanation of a senior official of the National Bank of Cambodia responds to the comments about the printing of banknotes that are too large, difficult to store and colors that cause confusion.
