Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh speaks at the closing ceremony of the 5th joint exercise "Neak Meas - 2023" between the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and the Chinese People's Liberation Army held in Kampong Chhnang province on April 5, 2023 under the theme "Security operations in major events and humanitarian relief of both Cambodian and Chinese armies" at the Military Police Training Center (Phnom Chum Reak Reay) in Peam Commune, Samaki Meanchey District, Kampong Chhnang Province.
Samdech Picheay Sena Tea Banh stated that the qualifications that led to Cambodia to hold joint exercises between the Cambodian and Chinese armies are many, many issues, the most important problem is that we have a lot of lack of materials, means, especially the work for the exercise. Therefore, any friendly country that wants to come to exercise with Cambodia must be a supplier of equipment according to Cambodia's needs.
In addition, Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh said that some countries, when they saw Cambodia conducting exercises with the Chinese People's Liberation Army, came to ask about various issues, but did not come to discuss any practical cooperation. No Chinese.
"And there is no help for Cambodia to move forward, only the People's Republic of China militarily is helping in every way." This is an additional emphasis of Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh.
The Minister of Defense confirmed that the equipment and equipment used for the joint exercise between the two armies belonged to the Chinese People's Liberation Army, especially the Chinese side continued to hand over to the Cambodian army for use. Samdech considers that this is a matter of great pride and gratitude for the Cambodian army to be able to train and be able to use all these materials.
