In connection with this case, another person named Khan Visal, 21 years old, who is the head of the nationwide sales inspection of Tokoyu Japan AutoPhat, a supplier of auto parts products, was also arrested by Mr. MOT Dara, Deputy Prosecutor of the Prosecutor's Office. Phnom Penh has issued a concluding order to send the case to the investigating judge, according to the complaint of the owner of the above company related to "breach of trust."
