While working for a company that has not yet terminated their contract, the two used their hours during the smuggling process using various means and company vehicles to sell products to the company's customers and sales staff. Other factions.
After Khan Visal resigned from the company and incited and incited employees of other companies to stop working for this company, such an act is a breach of trust by the governor, which seriously affects and damages the company. Most.
