Chairman of the Foreign Affairs Committee of the Chinese National People's Congress: China is ready to continue working closely with Cambodia on the regional and international stage
(Phnom Penh) - Lou Qinjian, Chairman of the Foreign Affairs Committee of the National People's Congress (NPC), confirmed that China is ready to continue working closely with Cambodia to implement the existing cooperation between the two countries and continue to support Each other on the regional and international stage to achieve a real multilateralism, fair and equal.
In his message of thanks, Lou stressed that the traditional friendship between Cambodia and China has been continuously strengthened and expanded in all fields to promote the development and interests of the people of the two countries.
At the same time, Mr. Lou stressed that in the cooperation between the two parliaments, Cambodia and China have always cooperated and promoted exchanges of leadership visits at all levels in order to maintain and promote Cambodia-China relations, adhering to the common vision and interests. For the progress and prosperity towards building a community of common destiny between Cambodia and China.
The Chairman of the Foreign Affairs Committee of the National People's Congress (NPC) stressed that Cambodia and China will continue to strengthen the historical friendship and brotherhood of the two countries based on the principles of mutual respect, trust and equal sovereignty. Non-interference in internal affairs and win-win cooperation.
