Businesses face many legal requirements, and the authorities need to work together to develop clear and consistent policies. To fill the gaps related to dispute resolution mechanisms and consumers, Cambodia can learn from the experiences of other ASEAN countries. Innovative approaches to educating consumers and businesses, for example through mobile apps or social media campaigns, can also be examined.
