Tycoon Kith Meng's Wing Bank expands with new branch opening in Banteay Meanchey
(Banteay Meanchey): Banteay Meanchey Province welcomes the presence of a new branch of Wing Bank as it expands to provide quality financial services throughout the Kingdom of Cambodia.
Wing Bank (Cambodia) CMC, a bank for all Cambodians, has expanded its reach with the opening of a new branch in Banteay Meanchey province.
The inauguration of this new branch is a significant step forward for Wing Bank in continuing to provide innovative and high quality digital banking services to all Cambodians throughout the Kingdom of Cambodia.
The location of Wing Bank Banteay Meanchey Branch is on National Road 5, Village 3, Sangkat Preah Ponlea, Serey Sophorn City.
The inauguration ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Rath Sovannarak, Assistant Governor and Inspector General of the National Bank of Cambodia, and Mr. Ly Sovannarith, Deputy Governor of Banteay Meanchey Province, as well as Oknha Kith Meng, Chairman and CEO of Wing Bank. Royal Group, as well as many dignitaries and guests.
The opening of this new branch is part of Wing Bank's strong efforts and commitment to serve all citizens wherever Wing Bank can access its services. Provide a wide range of products and services to meet the needs of individuals and business owners.
Mr. Han Peng Kwang, General Director of Wing Bank, expressed his pride in opening a new branch in Banteay Meanchey province.
"We want to help our customers address the challenges, and this new branch demonstrates our commitment to making a positive difference in Cambodia," added Han Pengquan.
Wing Bank is committed to helping all Cambodians access banking services and considers financial technology as the core to promote the wider use of banking services. The Wing Bank App, for example, is easy to use and highly secure, allowing customers to easily access their bank accounts, transfer money, pay bills, water and electricity and leave more transactions without leaving home.
Wing Bank has grown rapidly in almost two years since its inception as a commercial bank, to date, expanding to 15 strategic locations in Cambodia. Throughout Phnom Penh and also expanded to Sihanoukville, Svay Rieng, Siem Reap, Battambang and Banteay Meanchey.
Wing Bank's Banteay Meanchey branch is another great achievement that local banks are proud to have equipped with digital technology to meet customer needs and provide highly innovative financial products, which is one of the key examples of the system. Banks in Cambodia.
With more than half a billion US dollars in deposits, Wing Bank is evolving into one of Cambodia's leading banking institutions with attractive deposit rates and innovative digital lending services. Gain more trust from customers all over Cambodia.
Wing Bank is committed to contributing to the growth of the Cambodian economy by ensuring that more Cambodians have access to financial services, which is a significant contribution to improving the level of the financial environment in Cambodia. Wing Bank, a bank for the people of Cambodia!
