Kampong Speu becomes the fourth province to be recognized as a province to stop open defecation
(Kampong Speu): In the last 10 years, Cambodia has made significant progress in reducing open defecation in rural areas, and the number of households implementing open defecation has dropped from 62% in 2010 to only 16% in 2022. At this time, Kampong Speu has become the fourth province to declare an end to open defecation.
