(Preah Sihanouk): Two suspects were arrested by Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police after they hurled stones at the windows of people's cars on the road on the night of April 1. In 2023, the point of O Trav slope is located in Po Thuong village, Bit Trang commune, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province.
