The two suspects confessed that on April 1, 2023, they both rode a motorcycle from Wat Kiri Sokharam in Po Thuong village, Bit Trang commune towards Sihanoukville to search for a group of hippies. Enter the pagoda to find a conflict with your group. After riding for about 400 meters, the two of them stopped the motorbike and picked up a stone and placed it in front of the driver's thigh.
Later, about 100 meters ahead, he saw a car in the opposite direction turn on the headlights, making it difficult for the two of them to see the road. At that time, Heng also turned on the headlights two or three times Asking the car to turn down the headlights, but the car did not, Heng then threw the stones he had picked up at the car.
