(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sou Socheat, the Royal Government Delegate in charge of the Director General of the Securities Regulator of Cambodia, on April 3, 2023, said that the important factors in promoting the development of the securities sector as well as the economy. The whole of Cambodia is human resources.
This statement was made on the occasion of Mr. Sou Socheat participating in the finals of the Goodwill Ambassador Competition 2023, which was held at the Cambodia Securities Exchange on April 3, 2023.
Mr. Su Socheat stated that "The key factor in accelerating the development of the securities sector as well as the Cambodian economy as a whole is human resources, so for our country to grow fast, it requires our participation. "Everyone is needed."
