Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of the inauguration of Krouch Chhmar District Referral Hospital
(Phnom Penh): Under the policy of improving public health services to ensure the survival of people from various diseases, the Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has been modernizing both treatment and facilities. Doctors in many hospitals in Cambodia.
On April 3, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, inaugurated two large buildings of Krouch Chhmar District Referral Hospital in Tbong Khmum Province with many modern medical facilities. On that occasion, Samdech Techo spoke for more than 1 hour and 20 minutes, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen congratulates with new achievements on the land of wedges.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara for his efforts in building a large hospital in Krouch Chhmar district.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the effort to build this hospital is an effort to improve the well-being of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Krouch Chhmar district used to be a remote area and did not have a connected infrastructure system, so some patients were rescued and died.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Krouch Chhmar District Referral Hospital not only helps the people of Krouch Chhmar District, but also helps other adjacent districts.
