The Cambodian Footwear Association co-organizes an online workshop on updating procedures and procedures for requesting suspension of workers' contracts through automation.
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Shoe Association has partnered with the Association of Travel and Leather Products in Cambodia to organize an online workshop on updating procedures and procedures for requesting suspension of workers' contracts through an automated system.
The workshop organized on March 31, 2023 at the General Secretariat of the Cambodian Footwear Association was attended by professional officials of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training as speakers, including:
1: Mr. Khem Bun Chhean, Director of Labor Inspection Department
2: Mr. Kun Samphan, Director of Labor Inspection Office
3: Mr. Leang Sopheak, Deputy Chief of Labor Inspection Office.
In particular, according to the words of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, in order to help maintain stability and alleviate the living burden of workers in the above target areas, Samdech decided to extend the Royal Government's subsidy package to workers whose contracts have been suspended. Employment by factories affected by the global economic crisis is an additional $ 40 per person per month.
The 3rd China-Europe Music Festival and a concert to celebrate the 50th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Spain, organized by the General Administration of Radio and Television of China
BEIJING: On the occasion of the 50th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Spain, the "Third China-Europe Music Festival and a concert to celebrate the 50th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Spain" Hosted by China Central Radio and Television, it was successfully held on March 31.
Rafael Dezcallar, Spanish Ambassador to China, said in a video that he thanked the Chinese Central Radio and Television for hosting the concert. He said that music and culture are important forms and bridges between people of different countries. He believes that this concert will make the Spaniards better understand the transport from China and make the Chinese people better understand Spanish culture.
