(Kratie): Mr. Ngy Tayi, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, on March 1, 2023, inaugurated the statue of Samdech Preah Moha Sometheathipady Chuon Nath and other achievements in Wat Chroy Ampil is located in Chroy Ampil village, Chambok commune, Prek Prosop district to commemorate.
Ngy Tayi pointed out that the site of the stupa was originally a well, which was later used by the Khmer Rouge as a site for slaughtering about 2-3 thousand people. The monument was built so that people would not forget and always remember the Khmer Rouge genocidal regime that killed so many people in the area.
Taking this opportunity, the people also reminded of the great merits of Samdech Preah Moha Sometheathipady Chuon Nath, who provided a place for Ngy Tayi to stay at Wat Ounalom to study for 3-4 years, and Samdech was A sage who left countless works for the next generation of Cambodians.
