Mr. Ngy Tayi also instructed the next generation to work hard to learn, because only knowledge is with us and lead us to success in life, and today's society is focusing and strengthening the education sector in training. Human resources to have real knowledge and skills to participate in leading, building and developing the country to the international stage. 179 Families in Pailin Province Affected by Typhoon Receive Humanitarian Donations from Samdech Techo Hun Sen
