Syrian Foreign Minister Visits Egypt for First Time in a Decade (Video inside) (Cairo) A decade and the latest sign of the Arab world on strengthening ties with President Bashar al-Assad. This is according to the publication by the AFP news agency on Saturday, April 1, 2023.
The Egyptian Foreign Ministry released pictures of the two ministers in a closed-door meeting ahead of a broader round of talks. The Syrian state news agency SANA reported that the talks were aimed at strengthening ties between the two countries.
