(Svay Rieng): Ms. Men Sam An, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection and Chairperson of the National Working Group for Field Visit to Svay Rieng Province, on April 1, 2023, led a New Year celebration. Khmer national tradition in Svay Rieng province.
