He said that the Svay Rieng provincial administration will continue to strengthen fruitful friendships and cooperation in all fields for the benefit of the people on both sides and contribute to promoting economic growth and development in the border areas of peace, brotherhood and sustainability.
At the same time, Ms. Men Sam An continued that after reopening the country after the 19-Kovid Crisis, Cambodia-Vietnam still maintained good neighborliness, traditional friendship, comprehensive cooperation and long-term stability.
