(Phnom Penh): At least 31 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on March 31, 2023 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on March 1, 2023.
