Cambodia, China discuss promoting use of local currency for cross-border trade settlement
A bilateral meeting on the sidelines of the forum was held between Chea Serey and Xuan Changneng, Deputy Governor of the Central Bank of China, to discuss strengthening financial cooperation between the two central banks.
Topics discussed at the bilateral meeting include promoting the use of local currency for cross-border trade payments and enhancing the central bank's payment and digital currency connectivity.
The two Deputy Governors welcomed the closer cooperation to develop appropriate policies and solutions to promote the above-mentioned topics in order to increase the resilience and efficiency of the payment network, as well as facilitate trade and commerce. Encourage more investment between the two countries.
The construction of this stupa started on August 20, 2022 under the presidency of Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense.
In the cause of liberating the nation and the people of Cambodia from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, the Armed Forces of the National Salvation Army, formed by Comrade Hun Sen on May 12, 1978, many people were killed, injured and disabled.
The construction of the Great Stupa for the remains of the Cambodian Armed Forces of the Cambodian National Salvation Army was carried out under the direct guidance and guidance of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
After being buried in Vietnam for 44 years, the remains of 49 Cambodian National Salvation Army fighters were paraded from Vietnam on November 2, 2022 and cremated and temporarily stored at the Friendship Building in the Techo Military Historical Area. Koh Thmor X16 on December 2, 2022.
Along with the inauguration of the Great Stupa, the remains of the 49 fighters of the Armed Forces of the Cambodian National Salvation Army will be paraded in the Great Stupa on April 2, 2023 under the presidency of Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh.
On the afternoon of April 1, 2023, General Sao Sokha, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the National Gendarmerie, held a religious blessing ceremony before the inauguration ceremony.
The construction of this stupa is a reminder of the great merits of the martyrs and also the arrangement to take care of their merits to the motherland.
The Great Stupa was built in a grand style with a luxurious Khmer style fancy. The stupa costs about $ 700,000. CPP Office Building in Chamkar Leu District, Kampong Cham Province, with a Construction Cost of Nearly 2 Million USD, was Officially Inaugurated
(Kampong Cham): The headquarters of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province, along National Road 71, which cost about $ 1.8 million, was officially inaugurated on the morning of the 1st of this month. This April 2023 will be chaired by Deputy Prime Minister Yim Chhay Ly, a member of the Standing Committee of the Central Committee and Chairman of the Kampong Cham Provincial Party Working Group.
On that occasion, Mr. HUN Manith, Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group visited Chamkar Leu District, said that the construction of the CPP headquarters in Chamkar Leu District began on January 13, 2022 and was completed on March 31. 2023, using a period of 14 months.
Mr. Hun Manit continued that the construction of this magnificent party headquarters is a reflection of the strength and solidarity of the leaders, party members, as well as a reference for the nation and people.
At the same time, Deputy Prime Minister Yim Chhay Ly praised the leadership of Mr. Hun Manit, not only the party headquarters in Chamkar Leu district, but the party has offices in all eight communes. As the ruling party has the will and direction to lead the country for a long time, the arrangement of the district and commune party headquarters are all proud and show the strength of the Cambodian People's Party that no other party can compare.
In addition, it shows the solidarity of party members, philanthropists and people who trust and give eternal support to Samdech Techo Hun Sen and always vote for the CPP in both national and sub-national elections for the Cambodian Party. Continue to fulfill the duty to serve the people and develop the country to be more prosperous and prosperous in all fields.
Deputy Prime Minister Yim Chhay Ly also thanked district party members, commune branches, local party branches in Chamkar Leu district and provincial party working groups to visit and solve difficulties and mobilize budget resources for local development. Village, commune in Chamkar Leu district. This is the strength of the Cambodian People's Party and the connection of the people's well-being with the party working group to help the grassroots.
In this spirit, Deputy Prime Minister Yim Chhay Ly made a number of recommendations for the Central Party Working Group, the Provincial Party Working Group, the District, the Party Youth Focal Point and all party members in Chamkar Leu District to pay more attention to implementing a number of tasks, including: :
* First, make efforts and promote the implementation of the instructions of the Standing Committee of the Central Committee on the Joint Plan for the 7th National Assembly Election (both before the election campaign, the election campaign, the day Voting and post-election)
* Second: Continue and increase work activities, visit the work base, visit the backs of people's houses in order to grasp the problems and strive to solve the requests and challenges of the people, both the service needs and the request services.
* Third: Strengthen internal consensus in terms of views, positions and actions in striving to carry out all political tasks, increase the fighting spirit to win the election in 2023 to contribute to ensuring the long-term leadership of the party to Avoid emotional problems, pacifism, look down on rivals, lie down and look at each other.
* Fourth: The Party Committees of Chamkar Leu District and all 8 communes must adhere to the political program and all the principles of the party in order to continue to lead the work at their local level to adhere to and strictly implement the principle of collective leadership, each leader is responsible And how the party works
* Fifth: Continue to strengthen the management of members and build new members, especially young people of voting age, in accordance with the principle of "strengthen the old, build new" by striving to make one member a vote for our party.
* Sixth: Continue to pay attention to help solve difficulties and improve the living standards of party members, party organizations in Chamkar Leu district, members of the Chamkar Leu District Officials Fund Association and Chamkar Leu District Teachers Foundation Association, such as providing loans by Low interest rates and so on.
