He added that today's action is due to the cooperation and support from customers and users of Vital products, which Vital has always maintained its mission to deduct 25 R from a bottle of Vital of consumers. Funds for charitable activities and social work since the day Vital first entered the market.
On that occasion, Mr. Sok Po said that on behalf of the National Blood Transfusion Center of Cambodia of the Ministry of Health, all civil servants and staff are very honored to cooperate with Calmette Hospital and Vital to promote voluntary blood donation. With the aim of ensuring a safe supply of blood in sufficient quantities in a timely manner to save the lives of all victims, patients who need blood in a timely manner.
