Analysis: What Bush did 20 years ago is what Putin is doing 20 years later
WASHINGTON (Reuters) - Before ordering troops to invade Iraq in 2003, former US President George W. Bush has accused Saddam Hussein of smuggling Iraqi nuclear weapons after finding no nuclear weapons. And American politicians have called the US-led invasion of Iraq "an operation for the freedom, democracy and prosperity of the Iraqi people."
