Key Remarks by Samdech Techo HUN SEN Opportunity to Present Certificates and Diplomas to Trainees and Students of National Institute of Business
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Thursday, March 30, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the handing over ceremony of certificates and diplomas to more than 6,000 trainees and students of the National Institute of Business after their graduation. Study successfully. The event was held at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
On the occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech at about 1:30, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks for understanding and tolerance for failing to attend the opening of the National Assembly. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this failure was due to the notification from the National Assembly later than Samdech's work program. Samdech Techo asked the National Assembly to drop the program a little faster because Samdech has a lot of work to do.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the training of human resources in Cambodia is not just beginning now, it has been considered since the day of liberation on January 7, 1979.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the invitation to distribute Dr. Hun Manet's diplomas in various educational institutions is in line with the desired youth standards.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that before training to fight to destroy each other, but now training to get development.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the more skilled Cambodians will attract more investors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that currently Cambodia can produce about 9 million tons of cement.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the 19 era of Kovid made the digital development of Cambodia rapidly. Samdech Techo Hun Sen introduced and encouraged the development of digital even more.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that despite the warnings of the global economic crisis, Cambodia has not reached the level of running out of money in the bank. Samdech Techo calls not to panic and to withdraw money from the bank.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Russia can not destroy Ukraine and Ukraine can not destroy Russia. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said he expected the Russian-Ukrainian war to end. That end is by negotiation, not by ending the war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has expressed concern over climate change, which has worsened.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has passed from a self-sufficient economy to a commercial economy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he expects that the Cambodian people will not believe the opposition group on the price of goods on the market, which is a communist economy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that some officials asked their wives to arrange hong shui at work, to interfere in the affairs of their husbands, and finally lost their positions. Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns officials not to let their wives and children use their roles and powers
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Opposition party will use Cambodia's economic downturn due to the global crisis as a topic to attack the leadership of the Royal Government
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Prime Minister of Malaysia revealed the plan of the opposition group to take Malaysian territory to act against Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated his busy schedule, stating that on April 4, he will travel to Vientiane, Laos to attend the Mekong International Committee Summit and on In May, Samdech will travel to Jakarta, Indonesia to attend the ASEAN Summit.
