The Director of the Department of Education stated that from the first day of the opening ceremony of the camp, all the young people actively participated in the activities according to the program and the activities planned and achieved results with pride.
The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, said that it is a great honor for the province as well as the Provincial Department of Education, Youth and Sports to organize this youth camp, as well as to open a new page in the history of our province.
He said that the youth camp is a program to develop and increase the capacity of young people, which is indispensable in education, because this camp makes young people observe, consider, increase the spirit of teamwork, collective decision-making, love and care. Protect the environment responsibly in the spirit of strengthening friendship and solidarity, especially the participation of young people in maintaining peace and community development.
