Tomorrow morning, Samdech Techo Presents Certificates and Diplomas to More Than 6,000 Trainees and Students of the National Institute of Business
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Thursday, March 30, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen will preside over the handing over ceremony of certificates and diplomas to more than 6,000 trainees and students of the National Institute of Commerce after they graduate. Successful study. The event will be held at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
