The Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, creating jobs for people in rural areas is an important policy. In order to expand work closer to people's homes, the Royal Government always encourages investment in the provinces and rural areas.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, welcomed the large investment project and said he saw the port as an important waterway link. In particular, water for transporting agricultural products from the northwestern provinces to international markets.
The first large-scale investment project in Kampong Leng district is expected to provide about 1,500 jobs after the project is launched. Officials and local residents of Kampong Leng expressed their happiness and welcome to this investment project. They expect that the investment project will contribute to improving people's livelihoods by facilitating the transportation of agricultural products and providing employment to people working near their homes and not migrating far away.
Mr. Yem Leakena, Governor of Kampong Leng District, said that the project to build a multi-purpose port and logistics center is the first major investment for Kampong Leng district. The district governor expressed the hope that this investment project will contribute to making Kampong district no longer have a good economy, not as calm as before.
Ms. Kuy Channy, Chief of Kampong Hav Commune, said that the investment in the construction of the multi-purpose port and logistics center has provided employment to the people in her commune with income to support their livelihood, not difficult to migrate to work away from home. She expressed great pleasure for this investment.
San Sen, 55, a resident of Kampong Hav commune, used to migrate to work in construction in Phnom Penh. He has now moved back to work on this investment project. Mr. San Sen can earn about $ 500 a month from the construction site.
The resident of Kampong Hav commune enjoys working close to home with his family and has more money than working away from home.
The above investment projects have received strong support from national and sub-national authorities. It was observed that the leaders of the relevant ministries and institutions as well as the provincial leaders were visiting the company's construction process frequently.
During the inspection visit, Senior Minister Sun Chanthol praised the construction of the company. Build quickly and accurately according to technical standards. The Korean Peninsula is busier and more tense day by day.
