Brigadier General Tith Samnang, Deputy Commissioner of Criminal Planning of Kampong Thom Provincial Police confirmed that on the night of March 27, 2023 at 20:20, there was a case of intentional murder (shooting) at the victim's house. Damrey Slab village, Andong Po commune, Taing Kork district, Kampong Thom province.
According to the Deputy Commissioner, the suspect, Tim Sovannarith, a 29-year-old man from his hometown in Siem Reap Province, currently living in Phnom Penh, 2004 Street (Borey Sona), who works as a tattoo artist and embroiderer, fired a shotgun at his family. The victim, who was sitting in the basement, killed two people and seriously injured one.
