(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khleang Huot, Deputy Governor of Phnom Penh, on the morning of March 28, 2023, led professional officers in cooperation with real estate and mortgage business regulators to inspect motorbikes confiscated from pawnshops and distribute them legally. Also not in accordance with the law to return the motorcycle owner.
