At the same time, the government has made it easier for 19 Muslim patients who have been hospitalized to receive halal food and given the opportunity for Islamic doctors to contribute to the fight against the 19-year-old campaign. Samdech Techo TYDA volunteer doctors and some of them have been included in the Ministry of Health.
