(Phnom Penh): Oknha Leng Navatra and his four siblings, Oknha Leng Pros, Oknha Leng Nimol and Oknha Leng Panchaporn, donated $ 500,000 to the Techo 125 Foundation with Samdech Techo Hun Sen Honorary President of the 1978 Army Veterans Alliance and Founder of Peace in Cambodia.
Among the dead were an eight-year-old boy and two nine-year-olds, while the three staff members who were shot dead were between 60 and 61 years old. The Japanese Ambassador praised the Cambodian NEC for holding its own elections on a regular basis and achieving good results.
At the meeting held on March 27, 2023, yesterday at the NEC, the Ambassador confirmed that for the 2023 election, the Japanese side hopes to be free, fair and just.
He said he would take the opportunity to meet with election stakeholders, especially considering helping local election observers.
He also thanked Prach Chan and stated that if given the chance, the Japanese side would invite the NEC chairman to watch the election in Japan.
The NEC Chairman also informed that the election in Cambodia has four stages: the stage of review of the voter list and voter registration, the stage of registration of political parties and the list of candidates, the stage of the election campaign and the stage of Vote and count the ballots.
Political parties have the right to campaign in all its forms and resources in public places. In addition, the NEC organizes equal programs for political parties to broadcast the party's political programs on state radio and television.
For the upcoming election, a total of 23,789 polling stations will be open from 7:00 am to 3:00 pm. The ballot counting process must be carried out at the polling station immediately after the close of the election. Agents of political parties present at the polling station and counting ballots have the right to file a complaint in the event of irregularities.
Regarding election observation, Mr. Prach Chan stated that the NEC always invites national and international observers to observe all elections, and in the future, the NEC will also invite observers to observe. Watch this election, too. In particular, the NEC will invite the embassies of countries in the Kingdom of Cambodia to observe the election.
The NEC Chairman further stated that the ballot counting record (Form 1102) was posted in front of the polling station for the recordings of political party agents and on the night of the NEC election. Publish preliminary election results through state media.
Mr. Prach Chan stated that the resolution of election-related complaints must be done according to the hierarchy from the polling station level, the Commune / Sangkat Election Committee, the Capital and Provincial Election Commission, the NEC and to the Constitutional Council.
Regarding voter education, the NEC Chairman informed that in cooperation with the election experts from JICA at the NEC, the NEC regularly visited and disseminated education to Students at some schools and universities. In addition, the NEC has produced educational materials and programs to disseminate through the media to the people to understand more about the election.
Regarding the election observation visit in the French Republic, Mr. Prach Chan stated that the electoral system in France is not the same as the electoral system in Cambodia, but the organization of the election has the same goal: the election must be based on multi-liberal democracy. Party.
Cambodia signs air transport service agreement with Morocco (Video inside) (Morocco): The Royal Government of Cambodia and the Moroccan government have already signed an air transport service agreement to promote the development of trade, economy, tourism and other sectors. Another between the two countries.
The signing ceremony took place during the official visit of Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, to the Kingdom of Morocco on March 27-28, 2023.
The Cambodian side was represented by Dr. Mao Havannal, Minister in charge of the Secretariat of State for Civil Aviation, and the Moroccan side was represented by Mr. Nasser BOURITA, Minister of Foreign Affairs.
He said that up to now, Cambodia has signed air transport service agreements and memoranda of understanding with 48 countries in the world. Authorities in Oddar Meanchey Province Arrest 15 Gangsters and Fugitives
(Oddar Meanchey): Authorities arrested a group of 15 gangsters for questioning at the Samrong Police Inspectorate. This incident happened on the night of March 26, 2023 at around 22:30 at the village. Rumduol Veasna, Sangkat Bansay Raak, Samrong City, Oddar Meanchey Province.
After receiving information from the people that there was a case of gangs chasing and fighting, caused by a gang of up to 15 people from Bansay Raak and Sambour Meas villages, provoked and chased. The victim, Kim Sai, alias Beot, a 23-year-old male, lived in the village where the incident took place and was dancing at a wedding party in Romduol Veasna village.
At the same time, on the afternoon of March 27, 2023, at 3:30 PM, Major General Huot Sothy, Provincial Police Commissioner, went directly to the Samrong City Inspectorate and instructed and met with the guardians of the 15 gangsters. That person will be banned from doing these activities at a later date.
The Commissioner confirmed in the evening of the same day that from today onwards, all crimes that occur, such as the gangster problem, all 5 city-district inspectors will not be allowed to happen if In any case, the authorities must crack down.
In front of him, seeing that in this case, the above 15 gangsters did not injure the victim and it was not a serious crime, the commissioner also assigned the Samrong City Inspector to just work. Introduce them next time, if the authorities catch them again, they will be sent to court without exception.
It should be noted that at present, the above 15 gangsters, including the confiscated exhibits, including 6 motorcycles, have been recorded by the Samrong City Police Inspectorate's Judicial Police Planning Task Force and signed a guarantee contract from their guardians to secure them. Go home as well.
Experts see Putin's plan to deploy tactical nuclear weapons in Belarus as a serious warning to NATO over its military support for Ukraine against its war of aggression. But what is a tactical nuclear weapon? How big is Russia's nuclear arsenal and who is in charge?
* What is a tactical nuclear weapon? A tactical nuclear weapon refers to a type of nuclear weapon that is used specifically to take advantage of the battlefield, not a nuclear weapon capable of destroying an entire city from the face of the earth. These tactical nuclear weapons can be equipped with short-range ballistic missiles, artillery or bombers.
