The reason why the masses need to know all these things is because they are the voters and the ones who have to give their votes in the election, because in reality, many politicians are hypocrites, that is, in front of the masses. They act like crazy, the theory overflowing to show that they are moral people, love social justice and be an example to the masses, but in fact are people who are obsessed with sex and indiscriminate prostitution.
