The Minister said this at the announcement and appointment ceremony of the Prosecutor of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Court yesterday, where Mr. Ek Sun Raksmey was appointed Prosecutor of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Court, while Mr. Ith Sothea (Former Prosecutor) has been appointed Deputy Prosecutor General of the Battambang Provincial Court of Appeal.
