Kirivong district agricultural community continues to strengthen its potential to promote agricultural production and people's livelihood in accordance with the policy of the Royal Government led by the Cambodian People's Party
(Takeo): Kampeng Sok Sen Sambo Agricultural Community In the morning of Sunday, March 26, 2023, organized a general meeting to summarize the results of work activities in 2022 and work direction for 2023 under the chairmanship of Mr. Chhey Roeun, Secretary of State of the Office of the Council of Ministers and Chairman. Party working group visited Kampeng commune.
Kampeng Sok Sen Sambo Agricultural Community is one of the 13 agricultural communities of Kirivong District, Takeo Province, which was established on March 20, 2015 with the aim of improving the lives of the people, especially providing easy capital for business. Agriculture and small businesses.
At the same time, in order to strengthen the potential of the community, the General Assembly agreed to distribute the profits to the shareholders according to the number of shares, while maintaining the principal, which is the share price to support the activities and business of the community going forward.
