Capital-Provincial Departments of Tourism have been working to disseminate the circular issued by the Ministry of Tourism on March 21, 2023 on the management of tourist flows and the improvement of tourism products and services on the occasion of the traditional New Year. Confirm the service fee and the use of national letters on the price list. Ministry of Labor instructs factories to strengthen fire prevention measures for the safety and health of workers
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training has advised factory owners to strengthen fire prevention measures to increase safety and improve the health of workers, especially this summer.
The Secretary of State stressed that to achieve a culture of occupational safety and health in the workplace is a long-term vision that requires the active participation and commitment of all parties, including the Royal Government, employers 'organizations, workers' organizations. Occupational safety and health professionals to turn occupational safety and health into a workplace culture and daily life.
To prevent fires in the workplace, the Secretary of State advised factory owners to pay attention to the following:
1. Regularly inspect and test fire protection systems and equipment, including fire hoses, automatic sprinklers, fire hoses, fire alarms, smoke detectors and automatic lighting in the event of a power outage.
2. Check for safe, unobstructed and unlocked emergency exits and automatic lighting in the event of a power outage.
3. Establish an emergency response, especially for enterprises that use flammable substances, and keep them separate.
4. Increase regular inspections of the power supply network, which may cause fires in the workplace.
