In the first quarter of 2023, no cases of malaria were found in Oddar Meanchey province
(Oddar Meanchey): Dr. Khlok Huot, Advisor to the Ministry of Health and Director of the Oddar Meanchey Provincial Health Department, said that as of the first quarter of 2023, there were no cases of malaria in Oddar Meanchey compared to last year. Only 1 case.
Remarks by Dr. Khlok Huot on the occasion of chairing the meeting of the Provincial Working Group on Malaria Eradication for the first quarter of 2023 on the afternoon of March 27, 2023.
