He added that the Royal Government has paid great attention to the health sector by establishing mechanisms from the national level to the grassroots level to participate, in order to prevent problems for the people in implementing the strategy. Nation by eradicating malaria in 2025.
In order to manage the risk of malaria outbreak in a timely manner, all provincial health officials and malaria eradication agencies must be involved in managing the disease situation and taking immediate action by diagnosing and treating the disease. In particular, identify areas with high mobility by testing blood and distributing mosquito nets to people in each locality.
