(Phnom Penh): In recent times, since the announcement of the collapse of some banks in the United States, the price of gold in the international market has risen steadily, causing the price of gold in Cambodia to increase with market fluctuations. International.
According to gold market analysts on March 24, the price of gold in the international market was $ 1993 per ounce, equivalent to $ 2401 per ounce (gold price in Cambodia). On March 25, the price of gold in the international market rose to 2007 dollars per ounce or 2,418 dollars per ounce.
He explained why gold prices are soaring now due to the financial crisis in the United States, especially when some US banks went bankrupt or bankrupt, and about 100 other banks were affected by the crisis. Finances that make them lose confidence in the dollar and buy gold because they understand that if there is a severe economic crisis, only gold is valuable.
At the same time, the global economic crisis caused by the war between Russia and Ukraine, especially during the visit of the Chinese president to Russia, which could escalate the situation. These factors will make the price of gold more expensive.
He said that while gold is rising and rising further, it is an investment opportunity for buying and selling gold directly or investing in derivatives through legitimate companies.
For Sok Heng, although the gold trend will continue to increase, he suggested that those who have gold bullion should sell some because the gold market fluctuates constantly. He said that although the crisis in the United States and Europe has pushed up the price of gold, for large countries such as the United States and the European Union, they will not let their currencies fall, they will find a solution.
