Samdech Techo continued that after the implementation of the above three priority technology roadmaps, the Royal Government is also preparing to launch three more priority technology roadmaps: First. Energy technology roadmap. Road map for tourism technology. Digital technology roadmap.
Samdech Techo stated, "These three new priority technology roadmaps will serve as a compass for relevant ministries and institutions, private enterprise development partners and the Cambodian people to plan in a consistent manner and develop a comprehensive strategy." Get the right technology and develop technology products to suit the real needs of Cambodia.
The Prime Minister noted that in recent years, the ecosystem for business ventures in the field of technology in Cambodia has progressed, including: local seed investors, private equity funds, investment funds, business support centers or businesses. Recent and co-working space.
