Through this consultation meeting, the two sides will exchange views, perspectives, visions and priority policies, as well as partnership strategies and development project nominations to set policy directions and strategies for cooperation in the coming years, as well as Address and meet Cambodia's development needs with the resources and financial support provided by the French government.
