Despite repeated urges from Ukrainian officials to increase arms supplies, Zelensky's comments now appear to be an open disappointment. Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Closing the Meeting of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries
(Phnom Penh): This Friday afternoon, March 24, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the closing ceremony of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries.
On the occasion of closing the meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for more than an hour, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the agricultural sector helped alleviate economic tensions, avoided the food crisis and food price inflation caused by the 19-Kovid crisis and the war in Ukraine.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at a time when the world is facing a food crisis, Cambodia has more than 6 million tons of rice left.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the 1980s was the beginning of the rice genocide campaign, even his father objected.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised to continue the vision of seed development and water resources to make rice more productive.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that no matter how much the world changes, Cambodia is not short of food.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as the world faces a food crisis, Cambodia not only ensures its complete food security, but also has a surplus of more than 8 million tons of agricultural products exported to 74 countries. Also. Apart from global problems, Cambodia also suffered from floods, but the families of the victims received more than 7,700 tons of rice seeds and vegetables from the Cambodian food reserve system to restore livelihoods.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen forbids interference in the work of the Agricultural Development Institute (CAD). Samdech Techo Hun Sen forbids the exchange of land for Kadi Agricultural Development Institute.
* For the production of rice seeds, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, please recommend to increase the production of pure rice seeds, flowers, enough to meet market demand. For this work, Samdech would like to provide 100 rice transplanters to the Ministry of Agriculture to distribute to agricultural communities that produce rice seeds.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen promotes cashew cultivation to turn Cambodia into a future cashew emperor.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the Ministry of Economy and the National Bank to invest to support the cashew policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says the state will cut $ 100 million for the rice sector
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed pure water companies to check the production not to open the lid with water.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says to promote the development of aquaculture by using aquaculture with economic efficiency and high market demand and strengthen the capacity of the private sector on quality and safety standards to develop the fishery value chain to lead Exit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the timber industry must be encouraged to facilitate the import of wood products to supply domestic demand and provide various livelihood options to forest communities to reduce pressure on forest resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the relevant ministries and institutions, competent authorities and sub-national administrations must strengthen cooperation to jointly prevent and crack down on forest crime and forest encroachment effectively.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs diplomats in other countries to become promoters and attract investors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advises to consider providing funds to support the livelihood of people in the dolphin conservation area who have lost their fishing.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recommends turning some farmland in the area of Kiri Sour milk cows into grass for the farm.
