(Takeo): Bati District Authority of Takeo Province, together with water resources experts, came out to confirm the land situation in Svay Kom Reservoir area in Doung Commune, Chambey Commune and Param Commune, Bati District, Takeo Province. Protested by various ministries and institutions, including protesting in front of the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology, demanding that the Ministry of Intervention grant them land ownership after enjoying the area for many years.
It should be noted that on June 16, 2022, the Royal Government issued a sub-decree to consolidate the private property of the state of Svay Kom Reservoir area with an area of 641 hectares and 46 acres in Doung Commune, Champey Commune and Param Commune, Bati District, Takeo Province and Provide private ownership to TP Moral Co., Ltd. in exchange for the excavation, restoration and preparation of the 154-hectare and 93-acre Swaycom Reservoir.
At the same time, the Office of the Council of Ministers on June 16, 2022 also issued a notification (S.C.N.) across the area of 154 hectares and 93A, which is 10 meters deep and shall be kept as property Public of the state and registered with the Takeo Provincial Administration.
Through the sub-decree and the NCC, it is required that TPMOral Ek Co., Ltd. work to solve the policy for the people who have been living and enjoying the actual benefits according to the actual situation and location by coordinating according to the facts to avoid conflicts.
After the Royal Government issued a sub-decree to subdivide the private property of the state and give ownership to the company, the provincial authorities and district authorities have set up a commission to measure the people, which so far more than 90 percent of the people Take the commission's decision, and the remaining less than 10 percent protest, leading some people and being known as land brokers in the area.
According to the commune chief, Pearam, who has been the commune chief since 1983, the location of the land where the people are protesting is in the Svay Khom Reservoir. In addition, the commune chief also confirmed that since the time of Mr. Chan Sarun, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, has informed the people that this land is in the pool can not issue a plan can only enjoy. Forever.
The Director of the Department of Water Resources and Meteorology of Takeo Province also confirmed that the location of the land that the people are enjoying and requesting is actually in the Svay Khom Reservoir, which the provincial administration, local authorities and relevant experts can not issue a plan. Ownership to them.
In the past, during 2020, according to the local authorities and the people involved, the provincial administration as well as the local authorities have also arranged for the people to enjoy this land, but with the land they applied for a license. This property is in the pool, so it is not possible to give them ownership.
The district governor continued that in the past, the district and provincial administrative working groups have jointly set up a working group to collect data on the land that the people enjoy, so that the people can point out the boundaries of the land to see how much land they are dependent on. Have the team draw a map to advertise how much land he enjoys.
