The Golden Dragon Exercise 2023 was held under the theme "Security Operations in Major Events and Humanitarian Relief of the Armed Forces of Cambodia and China" at the Military Police Training Center (Phnom Chum Reak Reay) in Peam Srok Commune. Samaki Meanchey, Kampong Chhnang Province.
The opening ceremony was presided over by General Hun Manet, Deputy Commander-in-Chief and Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, and Major General Chhin Min Thean.
Lt. Gen. Chin Min Thean said that the two armies could not only exchange and enhance lessons learned in security operations in major military operations, but also build mutual understanding on concepts. And the culture of strengthening and expanding the traditional friendship between China and Cambodia. In addition, the exercise will help deepen military cooperation.
The 5th Golden Dragon Exercise was held to exchange experiences and to enhance the capabilities of the Cambodian Armed Forces, not to intimidate anyone or any country.
Major General Thong Solimo, spokesman for the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, said that in the exercise, the Cambodian side had 583 troops directly involved, while the Chinese side had 257 troops. The exercise was planned a long time ago between the armies of the two countries, not by chance.
He said that the exercise is a link between the two armies in promoting good relations, enhancing solidarity, friendship, training, knowledge, exchange of experience, coordination, living and working with many nations at the same time. Collaborate as well as respond to non-traditional challenges.
Lt. Gen. Qin Minthean also said that the operation was the result of building a new Cambodian-Chinese community of common destiny, decided by Chinese President Xi Jinping and Prime Minister Hun Sen in February 2023. This.
This operation will run smoothly and successfully, further strengthening the traditional Cambodian-Chinese friendship. Cambodia and China are good neighbors with a history of long-standing friendship, good partners who trust each other, brothers and sisters like hands and feet, friends know each other.
Lt. Gen. Chin Min Thean said that the 65-year-old diplomatic relationship between Cambodia and China is a model of modern international relations. In the new era, Cambodia-China relations have undergone new development.
In this exercise, the Cambodian and Chinese armies can exchange experiences on security operations in major events and military activities, as well as increase mutual understanding on cultural concepts, strengthen and expand the traditional Cambodian-Chinese friendship. Brilliant.
According to Major General Chin Min Thean, the Golden Dragon Exercise, a good example of Cambodian-Chinese military cooperation, has already been successfully held four times. He said the Chinese side had assigned the navy to be responsible for transporting troops and equipment that had conducted naval and telecommunications exercises with the Cambodian army.
