Please be informed that this fasting month is called the month of Marathon, corresponding to the year 1444 Mohammad, when this fasting lasts for a whole month and the beginning of fasting is the Cambodian Muslims must start to stop eating all kinds of counting. From sunrise to sunset, it is possible to eat normally according to the rules of Islamic law.
The wounds are not self-inflicted wounds, but the practice of disciplining Muslims, as well as health care and psychological education and humanitarian encouragement.
The Golden Dragon Exercise 2023 was held under the theme "Security Operations in Major Events and Humanitarian Relief of the Armed Forces of Cambodia and China" at the Real Shooting Range of the National Gendarmerie Training Center in Phnom Penh Geography: Chrak Kov village, Peam commune, Samaki Meanchey district, Kampong Chhnang province.
The opening ceremony will be held in the presence of General Hun Manet, Deputy Commander-in-Chief and Commander-in-Chief of the Army, and Major General Qin Minthean, Deputy Chief of Staff of the Southern Region Army of the Chinese People's Liberation Army.
At the same time, General Ith Sarath continued that the Golden Dragon Exercise between the Cambodian-Chinese Army in 2023 is not a threat to any country or individual, and this exercise will be held every year to strengthen the capacity of the Cambodian Army. Only.
The General stated that the Golden Dragon Exercise 2023 is to exchange experiences between the armies of the two countries, Cambodia and China, and also to strengthen the capacity of the Cambodian army to be more effective.
General Ith Sarath added that the Golden Dragon exercise was not a muscular exercise or a threat to any country or individual. While neighboring Cambodia, there are similar exercises, such as the exercise between the US and allied forces with the Thai army.
General Ith Sarath also confirmed that the Golden Dragon exercise will also have the content of the exercise as a real force, moving around the location in connection with the actual situation and divided into stages according to reality.
On behalf of Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, General Vong Pisen, Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, General Ith Sarath expressed his appreciation and appreciation for the good cooperation between the leaders. The exercises of the two Cambodian and Chinese forces, which have cooperated well to organize the Golden Dragon Exercise 2023, went smoothly.
It should be noted that the 5th joint Golden Dragon Exercise 2023 between the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and the Chinese People's Liberation Army will officially start this morning, March 23, 2023. The Golden Dragon exercise lasts for 14 days, from March 23 to April 8, 2023.
