Cambodia attends meeting of the Steering Committee of the Global Partnership for Clean Water and Sanitation in New York, USA
On March 20-21, 2023, Dr. Ouk Rabun, Minister of Rural Development, attended a meeting of the Steering Committee of the Global Partnership for Clean Water and Sanitation in New York, USA. .
The meeting was organized by the Global Partnership for Clean Water and Clean Water for All, with the participation of members of the Steering Committee for the Global Partnership for Clean Water and Clean Water for All. Civilians, development partners, government representatives, the private sector and researchers for the purpose of reviewing progress reports, discussing key future action plans.
The meeting also discussed the framework, results and relevant strategies for 2021-2022 and the challenges encountered in the past, discussing and finding appropriate response strategies to improve the water supply sector. Cleaning and sanitation.
