In the press conference of the Spokesperson of the Royal Government on the success of the past 5 years of Prey Veng Provincial Administration on the morning of March 22, 2023, Mr. Chea Somethy said that from the implementation of the work from 2003 to 2022 issued 669,368 cards to 247,914 families, equivalent to 85% of the total 292,935 households, implemented in 13 cities / districts and 100 communes / sangkats, equivalent to 874 villages.
