Samdech Techo Hun Sen: The United States is the locomotive of the global economy, do not wish the United States to weaken, the US economy is good for the world, including Cambodia (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia on the 22nd This March 2023 states that the United States is the locomotive of the global economy, so do not pray for the US economy to weaken, because a good US economy is good for the world, including Cambodia.
This statement was made on the occasion that Samdech Techo Hun Sen presided over the graduation ceremony for nearly 5,000 students of Vanda Institute. The event will take place at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center on the morning of March 22, 2023.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that "the world can know, the United States is the locomotive of global economic growth. "Do not pray for the United States to weaken. If we pray for the United States to weaken, we see the 2008 economic crisis, from the collapse of the US bank to the crisis in Europe."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "Do not pray for the United States to weaken, let the US economy grow is good for the world, including Cambodia to benefit from the growth of the US economy or the economy of other countries."
In addition, Samdech Techo Prime Minister also asked not to compete to kill each other, but to compete for growth together, because when any country faces economic collapse will affect other countries in the world. Mr.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated, "All countries in the world do not want any country to have problems and please do not pray for any country to die economically because it is dangerous to ourselves."
At the same time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the United States and Europe are the markets of Cambodia, if the United States and Europe have a slowing economy will lead to buying problems because Cambodia exports to the United States and Europe, even rice is imported to the European market. Strongly because Europe prefers Cambodian rice because Cambodian rice is organic rice that is used by European standards.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also emphasized that Cambodia does not participate in any movement to overthrow the economy of any country because Cambodia wants a peaceful world, a prosperous world together.
Once again, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also called on people who have made deposits through the banking system in Cambodia not to panic about the collapse of two US commercial banks because it does not affect the Cambodian banking system.
Please be informed that in 2022, Cambodia exported goods to international markets worth more than 22 billion dollars, an increase of 16.4% compared to the same period in 2021. The United States is the country with which Cambodia exports more goods, reaching nearly $ 9 billion.
