The doctor continued through the topic "Yes! We Can End TB ”with the aim of raising hopes and encouraging senior leadership to increase investment, adopting new WHO recommendations, implementing new and effective initiatives Accelerate multi-sectoral activities and partnerships to end TB at the national, regional and global levels.
