Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Deputy Commander-in-Chief must have 4 stars, Dr. Hun Manet has been promoted to 4 stars since 2018, but he asked not to be promoted (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia on the 22nd March 2023 stated that the ranks of the Armed Forces, the rank of Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces must be four stars (General).
Speaking on the occasion of presiding over the graduation ceremony for the students of Vanda Institute, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that in principle, Dr. Hun Manet, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the Army, will be promoted to 4 stars from 2018. So he asked not to install.
Please be informed that His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, issued a Royal Decree promoting Dr. Hun Manet to the rank of General on March 17, 2023.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Do not pray for the economy of neighboring countries to decline because it will have a negative impact on the Cambodian economy (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, said that we can not pray for the Thai economy. Vietnam or the US-China economy is not declining because it will have a negative impact on the Cambodian economy, because countries and countries always trade and have economic relations with each other.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen made this statement during the graduation ceremony for nearly 5,000 students of Vanda Institute at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center on the morning of March 22, 2023.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the regional and global framework, Cambodia did not go to prevent the growth of neighboring countries or other countries, that is, only cooperate to continue socio-economic development to grow. All together.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister continued that the idea that wants the economy of neighboring countries to decline and make the Cambodian economy strong is a miscalculation.
He added that Vietnam has a population of nearly 100 million, Thailand has a population of more than 80 million, so if Vietnam and Thailand have any economic problems, it will affect trade and economy of Cambodia. Blocking the growth of Thailand and Vietnam is impossible.
In addition, the prince also mentioned the economic and trade relations with China and the United States, do not pray for the economic decline of China and the United States, because Cambodia also benefits from the growth of these two great powers. That too.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also stated that countries must not compete to kill each other, but must compete for growth together. Praying for a country's economy to slow down can endanger its own country.
At the same time, Samdech Techo also warned students who have graduated and continue to do business - work daily, do not have competition, destroy each other, instead have to compete for growth together, especially to strengthen the quality of hospitality, hygiene and reasonable prices. For customers, it is a fair competition.
Samdech Techo said, "This is a time of competition for growth, in which business, if we want our business to sell out, we do not want to destroy other people's business, we need to improve our quality."
