* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that universities from the United Kingdom may open in Cambodia in the near future.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his happiness and appreciation to the parents and families of all students who participated in supporting their children to study successfully until graduation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded graduates to pay attention to study hard to strengthen their abilities. Do not be strong among the weak.
