* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalls Senior Minister Pol Saroeun when he was the Governor of Takeo Province that he did not want medals, he just wanted the people to have enough food.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is not necessary to follow the vision of this country or that country to grow the economy, even speaking and eating are not the same. So be self-sufficient.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalls Senior Minister Pol Saroeun when he was the Governor of Takeo Province that he did not want medals, he just wanted the people to have enough food.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Sports Ceremony in Siem Reap was well organized.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the King was staying at the Royal Palace in Siem Reap, not the Royal Palace that burned down on March 12. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Palace, which burned down on March 12, was a building that the Queen Mother of Cambodia used to live in in 1953. In particular, other buildings are not flammable.
