(Rattanakiri): In a meeting with departments, units around 9 provinces and districts to prepare for the celebration of Khmer New Year on the afternoon of March 20, 2023, Mr. Ngin Nel, Acting Governor of Rattanakiri. The provincial administration plans to organize a fun New Year Sankrant for 7 days, from April 10 to 16, 2023.
He said that during the seven days, there will be exhibitions of products and achievements of departments, units around the provinces and municipalities, as well as the private sector, concerts and folk games, dancing and fireworks.
In this Sankranti program, the provincial administration has organized many programs, including religious programs, Krong Pali ceremony, prayer for happiness, Chamroeun Preah Parit ceremony, blessing on the zodiac, prayer and trot dance, New Year angel reception, sand mounding ceremony, entertainment ceremony. Fun like a Khmer traditional game program, throwing a box, throwing, sitting, hiding a towel, pulling a prince, and so on.
