(Phnom Penh): Major General Thong Solimo, Deputy Director of Information and Communication, General Command and Spokesman of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, said that observers from 10 countries will be invited to observe the 2023 Golden Dragon exercise between The Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and the Chinese People's Liberation Army. The 5th Golden Dragon Exercise will run from March 23 to April 8, 2023.
This statement was made by Major General Thong Solimo on the morning of March 21, 2023, when he held a press conference on the joint exercise between the two armies of Cambodia and China "Golden Dragon 2023" under Topic: "Security operations in major events and humanitarian relief of the Cambodian and Chinese armies."
