Lt. Gen. Thong Solimo said: "What is noteworthy in this exercise is that the steering team of the Golden Dragon exercise of the two countries (Cambodia-China) has invited observers from 10 countries of the nation. "Southeast Asia, and please note that in the past, the exercise in Cambodia does not refer to any country, Cambodia welcomes all countries that wish to conduct exercises with Cambodia."
At the same time, the Major General stated that for the 5th Golden Dragon Exercise between the Cambodian and Chinese armies, there was no use of heavy weapons as in the previous times, but the topics raised were useful and important. To the current situation.
"I would like to emphasize that the exercises between the Cambodian and Chinese armies were planned, not randomly or in response to the global situation," he said. That no. ”
