(Phnom Penh): Mr. Dominic Williams, Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary of the United Kingdom to Cambodia, expresses his deep congratulations and appreciation for the good governance of Phnom Penh and the maintenance of security and order with development. Phnom Penh is growing rapidly, with tall buildings mushrooming.
