The signing ceremony took place between Dr. Huy Hansong, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training and Mr. LEE Jaewang, Director of the International Cooperation Center of the Korea Occupational Safety and Health Agency on the afternoon of March 21, 2023 at the Ministry of Labor.
