(Pursat): Samdech Puth Chey Mony, Dr. Khim Sorn, Deputy Inspector General of the National Inspectorate of Buddhist Studies of the Kingdom of Cambodia and Chief of Phnom Penh, on March 20, 2023, attended the wedding ceremony and crossed the stupa at Wat Bakan, Pursat Province. .
On that occasion, there was also an invitation and participation from Preah Brahma Phiroth Keo Kan, Royal Council of Honor, Preah Por Vongsa Vimol, Provincial Chief, Preah Chao Chao Athika Wat Keo Vichey and Mr. Em Sothea, Director of Pursat Provincial Department of Cult and Religion.
