The ceremony proceeded as planned, with Krong Pali ceremony for the owner of the land, the procession of Nhom Pros Lay Kem to be kept in the new stupa, the blessing ceremony for Nhom Srey Krem Phin, the watering ceremony for Sokun Vary Grandpa, the performance of sermons and the wedding ceremony of the Buddha image.
