The Ung Foundation has supported a total of 56 families affected by two house fires in the first case in Chong Koh village, Sangkat Phsar Chhnang, Kampong Chhnang on December 5, 2022, and the second case. Recently, on March 12, 2023, in Phsar Chhnang village, Sangkat Phsar Chhnang, Kampong Chhnang city, 47 families were affected. Donations distributed to 1 family receive 1 million Riels and 10 cases of Provida natural spring water.
