In this case, the accused Ky Peng Ho was sentenced by the Phnom Penh Municipal Court on August 25, 2019 to 25 years in prison and fined 80 million Riel for paying into the state budget under the charge of "illegal production. "Drugs and illegal trafficking of drugs" in accordance with the provisions of Article 40 of the Law on Drug Control.
However, the man appealed while the Phnom Penh Municipal Court of Appeal upheld their sentence, after which the accused continued to appeal to the Supreme Court.
Please be reminded that the accused Ky Peng Ho was arrested on March 21, 2018 at the Bali Apartment, Room B1, 19th Floor, Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh. During the arrest, the anti-drug police confiscated more than 1 kg of drug exhibits.
