According to a statement from the Russian Foreign Ministry regarding the actions of the British government by imposing sanctions on Russian individuals and entities, as well as its efforts to provide military and technical assistance to Ukraine, the British Armed Forces A total of 23 propaganda, judicial and criminal institutions have been blacklisted by Russia.
