The inauguration ceremony of the first tire production of General Thai Technology (Cambodia) Co., Ltd., located in Sihanoukville Special Economic Zone, this morning, March 18, 2023, was presided over by Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province.
