The operation was carried out on the orders of General Santibandit, the National Police Commissioner, and General Mak Chito, Deputy Commissioner General of the Anti-Drug Crime Plan, under the direct command of Lt. Gen. Kheng Sarath, Director of the Anti-Drug Department.
The above crackdown took place on March 16, 2023 at 4:30 AM by the Anti-Drug Bureau (A10) of the Department of Anti-Drug Crimes and was coordinated by Mr. Oum Sopheak, Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
The arrested Chinese suspect, Liu Zhao, male, born in 1984, unspecified occupation, address: Room 813, 8th floor, Yeak Thai Condo, Street 214, Sangkat Boeung Reang, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh, and confiscated a total of 3,244 grams of drugs. .
At present, the suspects and exhibits have been sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court by the Anti-Drug Crime Department.
In addition to the existing information to the people, the General Commissioner also clarified the means by which the people can provide information or request the intervention of the police by calling the command number of the Provincial Police. 097 778 0006 or General Commission of National Police 117.
