(Kampong Cham): The great devotee of Buddhism, Chim Seat alias Pok, who was the mother or stepmother of Samdech Preah Udom Chakriya Dr. Chheng Bun Chhea, Vice President of the Buddhist Parliament of the Kingdom of Cambodia, passed away on Saturday, March 18, 2023. 11:29 a.m. Due to illness at the age of 72.
According to the confirmation of Samdech Preah Odom Chakriya Dr. Chheng Bun Chhea, obtained by Fresh News, the body of Chim Seat, a Buddhist monk called Pok, was kept in Banteay Chey village, Speu commune, Chamkar Leu district, Kampong Cham province for the dedication ceremony. Kosal is given to the soul according to the Buddhist tradition.
