Xi Jinping systematically commented on the Chinese Communist Party's understanding of the pursuit of modernization, answered "some questions on modernization" and first mentioned the Global Civilization Initiative, which provided China's plan to accelerate the modernization process. Global and promote the progress of human civilization.
These initiatives fully state that if a country wants to follow the path of modernization, it must adhere to the general rules of modernization and also adhere to the actual situation and features of its own country. Sharing opportunities together and together creates the future as well.
Today, a small number of Western countries are still propagating the "superiority of civilization", the "clash of civilizations" as well as the propaganda of the so-called "global values", that is, putting themselves as a priority, forcing other countries to pursue political ideology and This formula of capitalism only hindered the progress of human civilization and modernization.
As humanity stands on the corner of the age again as the world's first major party, the Chinese Communist Party offers its own answer. In the future, in the pursuit of modernization in the Chinese style, the Chinese Communist Party will strive to promote high-quality development, uphold international equality and justice, promote change and learn from each other, as well as show the world generosity and responsibility. The responsibility of a big country.
