On the morning of March 17, 2023, the statues of Preah Iso, along with the statues of his sons, Preah Skan and Preah Kanes, were laid to rest during the reception of jewels traded to other countries. The statues of Preah Iso and the statues of his two sons were recently trampled by unscrupulous criminals and were recently found and demanded to be brought back.
According to a report by the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts, the statue of Father Iso was found and returned from the family of Douglas Lachford in the United Kingdom in 2021. The statue of Preah Skan, the first son of Preah Iso, was discovered and received from the United States in 2021. Separately, the statue of Preah Kanes, the second son of Preah Iso, was discovered and received from the United States in 2023.
The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, highlighted that Iso is one of the supreme deities in Brahmanism. Skand in the form of a child is a war god or a great commander in heaven with a peacock vehicle.
Samdech Techo added that in ancient times, the Khmer people had a strong belief in Preah Skant, as he was the son of Preah Iso and a powerful general, as shown in the sculptures and inscriptions. As for Kanes, who has an elephant's head, he is a deity of intellect and overcomes obstacles, which is why he is one of the most revered deities in Brahmanism.
The reunion of the statues of the divine family now gives the important meaning of the reunion of the divine family after being separated due to war factors.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister highlighted that "now a divine family (father and two children) is reunited through the highest intelligence in the search for peace after being separated for more than four decades due to people "Iniquity was stolen from the Koh Ker group of temples during the 1970s."
Samdech Techo added, "Peace is very important, not only for ordinary people, even the divine family needs peace for the reunion of families."
