* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that peace brought the family of the deities Preah Iso, Preah Skant and Preah Kanes back together after about four decades of separation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has rapidly integrated itself regionally and internationally and is actively working to preserve the cultural heritage of humankind.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Government and the United States authorities for their good cooperation in preventing and returning Cambodian cultural heritage.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his gratitude and appreciation to the Royal Government of the United Kingdom, relevant authorities and the Embassy of the United Kingdom in Cambodia for their excellent cooperation and facilitation in the delivery of Khmer ancient statues and jewelry. Back to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the private sector to support more cultural activities.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen prays for the power of sacred objects and the souls of the Khmer ancestors in the commune and the Khmer people meet only happiness.
