She said that the peace that emerges from the win-win politics under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen has provided a golden opportunity for Cambodia to bring back the souls of ancestors and precious treasures that have been lost back to their homeland. Happiness and shadow for the nation and the people of Cambodia.
