Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Peace is an important foundation for Cambodia to regain the soul of the ancestral culture (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia this morning, March 17, 2023 Opportunity to receive some Cambodian jewels that have just been reclaimed from abroad after being lost for hundreds of years, claiming that peace is an important foundation that leads Cambodia to regain the soul of Cambodian ancestral culture.
In fact, the divisions and torn wars in the history of Cambodia have not only degraded the nation, the people have suffered, even the many artifacts that are the treasures of Cambodia left by the Khmer ancestors have drifted and disappeared. Many, but after Cambodia found peace, the nation was reunited and the treasure returned as well.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "Peace is an important foundation that brings Cambodia back to the soul of Khmer ancestral culture." "Peace has reunited the families of the gods, Preah Iso, Preah Skant and Preah Kanes, after being separated for about four decades."
At the same time, Samdech Techo Prime Minister expressed his happiness to receive Khmer artifacts received from abroad and welcomed with pleasure the return of the soul of this Khmer ancestor.
Please be informed that this recovered artifact is an invaluable national cultural heritage and the soul of many generations of Cambodians who were illegally exported abroad during The long-running civil war and insecurity that has occurred in Cambodia in the past.
The peace that emerges from win-win politics under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister provides a golden opportunity for Cambodia to bring back the souls of its ancestors and precious treasures that have been lost back to their homeland. Happiness and shadow for the nation and the people of Cambodia.
