Really disabled, but not mentally disabled! A disabled man buys scrap metal to feed his family and live a decent life
However, a man with two legs from birth, living in Kork Beng village, Sangkat Kampong Pranak, Preah Vihear city, Preah Vihear province, although he is disabled, he did not beg for food to feed his stomach, but he was engaged in the business of buying scrap metal. With a small income, the family lived a decent life like their neighbors.
Sok Phanna, a 28-year-old man with a wife, Khuth Kong, 32, and a young son, described being paralyzed from birth and living with a poor mother in the village. When you grow up, you feel a little upset because you are disabled.
Mr. Sok Phanna stated that he has been married since 2017 until today to have a beloved son and he plans to have another child soon. In particular, his scrap business has started for two years, and he can earn 20,000 riel per day just to make a living.
