During the meeting, President Xi Jinping said that since the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Cambodia more than 65 years ago, despite the international situation, the friendship between China and Cambodia has remained stable. Forever and has released a new strength, and bilateral relations have become an international model.
Xi Jinping said this was due to the deep ties between China's previous leaders and former King Norodom Sihanouk. Xi Jinping also reminded that the awarding of the Friendship Medal of the People's Republic of China to the Queen Mother in 2020 is to thank him for his special contribution to the friendly relations between China and Cambodia.
"We want to lead the friendly relations between China and Cambodia so that the friendship between the two countries can be passed down from generation to generation and write a new chapter in building a Sino-Cambodian community of the future," Xi Jinping said. Together.
The President also stressed that China is ready to work with Cambodia to build a framework for cooperation in six key areas and support Cambodia in building the "Industrial Development Corridor" and "Corridor". Fish and rice, ”he said, adding that his country was ready to accelerate the building of a Sino-Cambodian community of a future together.
