(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Thursday, March 16, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the graduation ceremony for 4,566 students of Build Bright University, 2,032 females. The graduation ceremony took place at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
On the occasion of Samdech Techo Hun Sen giving a speech for about 1 hour and 50 minutes, the following are the main contents of Samdech Techo:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in recent months, tens of thousands of students have been awarded degrees, which is a good journey for society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian People's Party is a symbol of social change.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) has led the transition from a divided country to a peaceful country, from a poor country to a low middle income country, and will continue to be a prosperous country. High average in 2030.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Phnom Penh used to have only one high-rise building, but now Phnom Penh has hundreds of buildings from 5 to 30 floors, 40 floors and hundreds of buildings.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian People's Party is the only party leading to change in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that from now on, the CPP will declare itself the only party of change in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises the growth and development of Build Bright University.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encouraged Build Bright University to continue to pay more attention to training.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on universities to strengthen the quality of education, especially in the provinces.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Kovid 19 pandemic has not been completely shut down and preventive measures cannot be completely eradicated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that during the New Year 2022, Samdech was very worried and scared about the outbreak of Kovid 19 after a large crowd.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen congratulates all Build Bright University students who successfully graduated and received their degrees today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all ministers should check the letter before signing both the spelling and the date.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalls the wrongdoing of the letter related to the marble investment proposal in Kampong Speu by the Office of the Council of Ministers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are four ministries that send letters to Samdech less guilty, including the Ministry of Interior, the Ministry of Economy and Finance, the Ministry of Culture and the Ministry of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen begs the Minister not to abuse Samdech in various documents. Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the Minister to re-learn how to write a letter to Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns to leak any ministerial letter that is wrong on social media.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expresses his condolences over the fire at the Royal Palace in Siem Reap.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen prays for the hand of the King of Banana, the King of Cham, not to tolerate those who distort the information and accuse the Royal Government and the CPP of burning the Royal House.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen denies allegations that the Royal Government and the Cambodian People's Party set fire to the Royal Palace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that no matter how much money is spent, the Royal Palace must be rebuilt. The Royal Palace is the historical site of the Father's National Liberation Movement.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces support for the Ministry of Education's instruction regarding bringing students to play games and folk dances. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the era of globalization, traditions and customs are easily lost.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls for attention to food safety during the traditional New Year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to believe in the management capacity of the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the campaign to defame Cambodia is starting again through the construction of Ream Sea Port.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Ream Port belongs to Cambodia, Cambodia built it as a Cambodian right.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in order to have good relations with ASEAN, all ASEAN member countries must have good relations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on foreign friends not to campaign to slander Cambodia over the construction of Ream Port.
