* Second: Regarding the 7th National Election, the authorities at all levels must work together to implement in accordance with the laws and regulations of the election procedures and work closely with the election authorities to promote retention. Security, order and security in the whole election process to unite to ensure the 7th National Election on July 23, 2023, free, fair and just.
