* Fifth, the management, security and development of the border area by the authorities and the armed forces at all levels must strive to promote, maintain and protect the territorial integrity, national sovereignty, and strengthen good cooperation with the competent authorities of the country. Neighbors maintain security and order in the border area, maintain border posts, take measures to prevent people from renting land along the border to the people of neighboring countries.
