China welcomes Honduras 'decision to sever ties with Taiwan (Video inside) (Beijing): Beijing on Wednesday welcomed Honduras' announcement on plans to sever ties with Taiwan. Re-establish official ties with China. This was released by the AFP news agency on Wednesday, March 15, 2023.
Chinese Foreign Ministry spokesman Wang Wenbin said: "Based on the one-China policy, China is willing to build friendly and cooperative relations with Honduras as well as other countries in China. In the world. "Therefore, we welcome the relevant statements made by the Honduran side."
Beijing welcomed the move after Honduran President Xiomara Castro on Tuesday announced that she had instructed the Honduran foreign minister to establish formal diplomatic relations with China. That Honduras will sever its current official relationship with Taiwan.
