Takeo Provincial Administration Rejects Fake Information Distributed on Social Media Related to Car Glass Throwing Ax
(Takeo): The Takeo Provincial Administration on March 15, 2023, came out to reject the false information fabricated by a group of unscrupulous people involved in sharing on social media the story of a gangster throwing an ax at the windshield of a passenger car.
In the statement of Takeo Provincial Administration, which was received by Fresh News, it was confirmed that the picture posted on social media on the night of March 14, 2023, with the image of the ax being thrown at the car window, said that it happened in Phsar Samrong area. Yong, Bati district, Takeo province, is false information. This case happened on November 10, 2022 in Phnom Sampov, Battambang province.
The Takeo provincial administration also claimed that the distribution of this baseless information has the character of Pho Hok, deception, incitement, distortion, and misrepresentation, causing the public to be confused.
