(Kandal): A car robbery happened in Ben Bor village, Preah Puth commune, Kandal Steung district, Kandal province on March 13, 2023, by tricking customers into buying a car and robbing it, but it was not successful because the car owner immediately complained And was chased by the police.
After this incident happened and the authorities and the people came out, the suspect decided to drive the car that the robber dropped into the canal and escaped.
According to the police, the victim, Choeun Sinuon, 41 years old, resides in Borey Phop Thmey Kambol 1, Khan Kampoul, Phnom Penh. The suspect does not know the identity.
According to the police report, at 10:30 on March 13, 2023, the suspect called the victim to say that he wanted to buy a car worth more than 30,000 dollars. After receiving the suspect's phone, the victim drove to pick up the suspect in the Tuol Pong area.
When the victim arrived, he rode with the suspect. When traveling on the road, the suspect stopped the victim and got out of the car. When he returned, he used a spray gun on the victim and used an electric shock to shock the victim until the victim opened the door and got out of the car, shouting for help.
After the victim shouted and the people helped to contact the police to catch the suspect until the car fell into the canal.
