The General Department of Immigration succeeds in managing the entry and exit of foreigners in Cambodia in 2022 and continues to strengthen this work to be more effective.
(Phnom Penh): In the morning of March 14, 2023, the General Department of Immigration held a meeting to review the work results of 2022 and raise the implementation direction of 2023 and disseminate the results of the work meeting 2022 and the direction of the Ministry of Interior under the chairmanship of Dr. Sok Phal, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Interior, in charge of immigration.
