In addition, in order to contribute to strengthening security, order and safety when Cambodia hosts the upcoming SEA Games and ASEAN Para Games, General Keo Vanthan confirmed that the General Department has assigned officers at all gates to strengthen inspections. Be sure to check in and out of guests, including general passengers, players and attendees.
