The inauguration ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Rath Sovannara, Assistant Governor and Superintendent of the National Bank of Cambodia, Ms. Hun Mana, Duke Kith Meng, Chairman of the Board of Directors of Wing Bank and CEO of Royal Group, as well as many other dignitaries. .
After officially launching its commercial banking license a year ago, Wing Bank has made it clear that it is a reliable partner that Cambodians can rely on to protect their savings with confidence and High security.
Han Pengquan, CEO of Wing Bank, said, "We could not have achieved all this without the strong support of our customers, partners and stakeholders." We will continue to be committed to providing the best banking solution for the people of Cambodia, in line with our motto, Wing Bank, Bank for the People of Cambodia. ”
In just one year, Wing Bank opened more than 10 branches nationwide to meet the growing demand for financial services. In 2022, Wing Bank opened Sen Sok Branch, Wat Phnom Branch, Toul Kork Branch, Boeung Trabek Branch and Preah Yukunthor Branch, all of which are located in Phnom Penh and the other branch is in Sihanoukville.
For the first few months of 2023, Wing Bank has opened four more branches in Battambang, Royal Group, SEZ, Royal Group, Phnom Penh, Siem Reap and Svay Rieng.
Wing Bank Orchid Branch 2004 will provide customers with a full range of banking products and services, such as: deposits, business loans, remittances and more. Wing Bank has a professional and friendly staff ready to serve customers in this new location, both locals and foreigners.
Wing Bank Orchid 2004 Branch is located at S. Has Air 1, No. 35, Street 2004, Orchide Village, Sangkat Opek Kam, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh, next to the entrance of Orchid The Royal on Street 2004. The branch is open Monday to Friday from 8am to 5pm and is equipped with state-of-the-art ATMs for free withdrawals.
