(Kandal): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, presides over here on March 12, 2023 the “Solidarity Flower Festival” for the construction of Samdech Preah Sangkhareach University in Kandal Province.
Mr. Kong Sophoan, Governor of Kandal Province, made a report to Samdech Krala Hom and the ceremony of the University of Samdech Preah Sangkhareach Bour Kry, initiated by His Majesty the King, His Highness Samdech Preah Abhisiri Sokunthea Kingdom of Cambodia.
According to Mr. Kong Sophoan, the university has Samdech Preah Mongkul Tepachary Vong Aneta, Samdech Preah Sang, Deputy Director of the Judicial Committee of the Kingdom of Cambodia and Preah Kun of the Judicial Council of Kandal Province as the Rector under the curriculum. Management of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports and has 5 faculties.
The five faculties include the Faculty of Arts, Humanities and Languages, the Faculty of Science and Technology, the Faculty of Social Sciences, the Faculty of Engineering and Architecture, and the Faculty of Development and Tourism, with a total of 20 majors. The first was in February 2023, providing 100% scholarships for study.
At present, Samdech Preah Sangkhareach Bour Kri University has 600 students, 23 students, and 97 staff members. The university has two locations, the first location is in the compound of Wat Preah Ind Samaki Thom and the second location is in Bek Chan commune, Ang Snoul district, Kandal province, the construction of a school building in the second location.
