* First: Security and order work
* Police, Gendarmerie, Kampong Cham Military Operation Area continued to cooperate and participate in law enforcement forces, authorities at all levels and support the participation of people from all walks of life through the implementation of the policy of safe villages, communes and sangkats. We are actively working to prevent and suppress crimes in the province even more effectively.
