(Kep): A new achievement, Road 1333, Phnom Vlor area, 1,900 meters long and 7 meters wide, with DBST paving, was opened on March 13, 2023 in the presence of Mr. Sam Sarin, Chairman of Kep Provincial Council. And Dr. Som Piseth, Governor of Kep Province.
