This evening, Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit inaugurated the movie "Sons Under the Light of the Full Moon"
(Phnom Penh): The film "Son under the full moon", which is a historical film and reflects the life of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen in the cause of the motherland, has been completed. . The Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the President of the Cambodian Red Cross, Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, will inaugurate the screening on Monday, March 13, 2023.
