Kampot has been declared a tourist destination with no cigarettes and is associated with the 3rd triumph of Rumduol Clean City.
(Kampot): The Kampot Provincial Administration held an official ceremony to declare Kampot City as a tourist city without cigarettes and to connect with the third edition of the Clean Rumduol 3 Victory City Award Ceremony for Kampot Province. The above ceremony took place on March 10, 2023 yesterday at Kampot Provincial Hall.
The ceremony was presided over by Mr. Hor Sarun, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism, Mr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Kampot Province, and the accompanying delegation from the Ministry of Health, the World Health Organization, the Southeast Asian Tobacco Control Federation, the civil servants, the Armed Forces, the authorities. Representatives of the people and students.
