The Secretary of State also called on the provincial and municipal administrations to inspire the active participation of all citizens by strengthening ownership in the development and maintenance of clean, environmentally friendly, smart and green cities.
Please note that the winners of Kampot will be awarded now:
* 1: The first smoke-free tourism city in Cambodia of the Southeast Asian Tobacco Control Federation. * 2: The Ministry of Tourism's Smoke-Free Tourism City Award * 3: Accreditation of Kampot City, the smoke-free tourism city of the Ministry. Tourism and the ceremony also paraded
