(Doha, Qatar): On behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, Minister of Commerce Lol Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, led a Cambodian delegation to the 5th United Nations Conference on Least Developed Countries (LDC5) and Meeting Top of least developed countries in Doha, Qatar, March 4-9, 2023.
As the Co-Chair of the High-Level Roundtable, Minister Pan Sosak briefed the Meeting on the main outcomes of the High-Level Roundtable and addressed a number of issues, including the global crisis and financial crisis. And limited resources in LDCs.
