Minister Thong Khon considers tourism events to promote agricultural products, environment and culture to tourists directly
(Kampong Thom): Organizing river festivals, sea festivals, tourism exhibitions as well as tourism events are considered to have contributed to the promotion of agricultural products, the promotion of cultural and tourism destinations, as well as the education and guidance of the environment.
Through the 7th River Festival in Kampong Thom Province, Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, noted the activities of the people to visit and buy local products at the exhibition booth, also busy with performances of art, dance, music, contemporary music. Compete and play sports as well as many other spectacles for the people and tourists who come to visit during the festival.
At the closing ceremony of the 7th River Festival on the night of March 10, 2023, Minister Thong Khon stated that tourism is an export on the spot, because when there are tourism events, there is participation from almost all Sectors such as agriculture, handicrafts and enterprises, community environment, culture, arts, sports, as well as education, advocacy and more.
"Tourism is the seller, agriculture is the producer, the environment is both producer and protection, and culture is both protection and promotion, so the promotion of those products is through tourism events," he said. This is it.
Mr. Thong Khon said that the development of tourism as well as the organization of tourism events are efforts to support the development of agriculture, environment, culture. He said that Samdech Techo Prime Minister always said that tourism is an export on the spot, all products are displayed in local products for people to buy and use.
He said that the cultural sector is to strengthen the management of community heritage sites of the people of traditional items, strengthen the performance of the performing arts to show to national and international tourists through tourism events.
Minister Thong Khon added that Cambodia has a lot of cultural potential, including intangible culture, history, heritage and other diversity of Cambodian culture. Cambodia has a contiguous World Heritage tourism network that no other country has.
