* First: Samdech Hun Sen fought to liberate the nation, liberate the people from the genocidal regime of Democratic Kampuchea, while the whole world did not think.
* Second: Samdech Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, found a win-win strategy that led Cambodia to real peace.
* Third: Compared to all political parties in Cambodia, he sees that the Cambodian People's Party is the first choice party that has the ability to lead Cambodia to peace and development and resist the aggression of foreign ambitions.
