Aleppo Airport was used to bring humanitarian aid to the victims of an earthquake that killed thousands in February. According to the UN, the Syrian Ministry of Transport has diverted all flights with assistance to Damascus or Latakia. The Israeli military declined to comment on allegations that Syrian state media were behind the attack.
